          "2초, 48kHz, 2채널, PCM16",
          "`5e316f55988b1c98c21f37dc94411a82f32404cd803eb353262e5cade760014f`"
        ],
        [
          "`build/real-audioldm/installed.wav`",
          "1초, 16kHz, 모노, PCM16",
